## 9. Failure Modes & Mitigations

| Failure | Mitigation |
|---|---|
| A shard is slow/down during scatter-gather | Timeout + partial results (better degraded answer than no answer); replica failover |
| OCR misreads scanned PDF → garbage chunks | Confidence scoring on OCR output; flag low-confidence docs for review/reprocessing |
| Embedding model drift after retraining | Dual-write old+new embeddings during migration, shadow-test recall before full cutover — never do an atomic hard cutover on a 22B-vector index |
| Hot-spot queries overload one shard | Caching layer + shard replication; route via consistent hashing with load awareness |
| LLM hallucinates despite retrieved context | Citation-grounded prompting + a post-hoc "faithfulness" check comparing answer to retrieved chunks |
| Duplicate/near-duplicate PDFs bloat index | Content-hash dedup at ingestion, near-dedup via MinHash/SimHash for near-identical docs |
| ACL bug leaks cross-tenant data | Filter pushed into ANN query itself, not applied post-hoc; regular access audits |

